{"id":"alert-service-offline","question":"服务下线告警通常应该如何排查？","reference_answer":"先查询最近一小时包含 panic 关键字的日志，再根据 panic 日志分析导致服务重启的代码问题。","relevant_doc_ids":["d2ca9503e96eee9364153da657db8408b9c5ab52c6f6fc6eed7ec63d8ca702ca"],"expected_tools":["query_internal_docs"],"tags":["knowledge","alert"]}
{"id":"alert-api-failure","question":"接口失败率过高应该如何排查？","reference_answer":"根据接口名和 response 关键字查询最近一小时日志，再根据日志中的 error 分析服务调用异常或下游不可用原因。","relevant_doc_ids":["6017feb8bdab6d54ceef17b1999cb763830c9209bdfbe4ac0a7199345ed4c8c6"],"expected_tools":["query_internal_docs"],"tags":["knowledge","alert"]}
{"id":"alert-reconciliation","question":"与下游对账出现差异时应该如何排查？","reference_answer":"使用 error 和 reconciliation 关键字查询最近一小时日志，并根据日志判断数据同步异常或计算错误。","relevant_doc_ids":["51c7eaaa4de6d8fb29231717042ca9c53bf4080241790cc2b610f767f4f60ce4"],"expected_tools":["query_internal_docs"],"tags":["knowledge","alert"]}
{"id":"alert-region-mismatch","question":"服务地域与资源地域不匹配时应该如何排查？","reference_answer":"查询包含 region mismatch 的最近一小时日志，汇总调用方和错误地域，检查是否使用了错误的 MQ 队列。","relevant_doc_ids":["f70885e2d68238888099fa77c4867cc52a86cf8f850fdace67132bac8a2f6af6"],"expected_tools":["query_internal_docs"],"tags":["knowledge","alert"]}
